<h2>Common questions</h2>
<p><strong>Where is my data stored?</strong> In your own private iCloud account
(Apple CloudKit). The developer has no access to it. The app also works fully
offline and syncs when you reconnect.</p>

<p><strong>How do I back up or move my data?</strong> Use Export Backup in
Settings to save an encrypted backup file. You can restore it on any device, or
keep it as an archive.</p>

<p><strong>I'm switching from another budgeting app — can I import?</strong>
Yes. Settings includes a guided wizard to import a register and budget plan
from a CSV export.</p>

<p><strong>Why does the app need a network connection?</strong> Only for iCloud
sync and to fetch public foreign-exchange rates for multi-currency budgets. See
the <a href="/privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a> for details.</p>

